{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/1en.png?t=1745675475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, you can sail a ship with your friends toward distant horizons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore faraway islands, hunt for treasures, and discover the perfect fishing spots!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/1t.png?t=1745675475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/2en.png?t=1745675475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whip out your fishing rod anytime, anywhere\u2014cast your bait into the water and start fishing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch fish of all sizes, rare species, and even bizarre mutated fish tainted by pollution!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/2t.png?t=1745675475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/3en.png?t=1745675475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your farmland\u2014it will be your vital source of food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cultivate crops you\u2019ve discovered from exploring other islands in your fields!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/3t.png?t=1745675475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/4en.png?t=1745675475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pets are your best companions, ready to lend a hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let them roam freely around your homestead, or pick one to adventure by your side!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go forth and find pets across different islands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/4t.png?t=1745675475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/5en.png?t=1745675475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Toss the ingredients you\u2019ve farmed or scavenged into the cooking pot\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wait\u2026 wait\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And a delicious feast will be ready!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655990?t=1745675475","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/d829abbbbb2f9f0ff7a49540327dd54b93e45fb4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745675475","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/39dd40a1a8e3370043b36c9a67265bc83127eae0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745675475","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/39dd40a1a8e3370043b36c9a67265bc83127eae0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745675475","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/1en.png?t=1745675475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, you can sail a ship with your friends toward distant horizons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore faraway islands, hunt for treasures, and discover the perfect fishing spots!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/1t.png?t=1745675475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/2en.png?t=1745675475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whip out your fishing rod anytime, anywhere\u2014cast your bait into the water and start fishing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch fish of all sizes, rare species, and even bizarre mutated fish tainted by pollution!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/2t.png?t=1745675475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/3en.png?t=1745675475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your farmland\u2014it will be your vital source of food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cultivate crops you\u2019ve discovered from exploring other islands in your fields!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/3t.png?t=1745675475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/4en.png?t=1745675475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pets are your best companions, ready to lend a hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let them roam freely around your homestead, or pick one to adventure by your side!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go forth and find pets across different islands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/4t.png?t=1745675475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/5en.png?t=1745675475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Toss the ingredients you\u2019ve farmed or scavenged into the cooking pot\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wait\u2026 wait\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And a delicious feast will be ready!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["\u70df\u718f\u6e14"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/3b9961ce63ee30fe9c0caeca55efb12383ceee02/header.jpg?t=1745675475","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257128260,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128260/movie480.mp4?t=1745342361","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128260/movie_max.mp4?t=1745342361"},"name":"1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257128260/6eb3c877c684b1dd7bdaf904765715f7965c439a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745342361","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128260/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745342361","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128260/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745342361"}}],"name":"Calm Horizon","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  i5-3570K 3.4 GHz 4 Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  i9-9900K 3.6 GHz 8 Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>